            "review_title": "Review at Banh Xeo CUOI Restaurants - Authentic Vietnamese Cuisines",
            "review_text": "OGGGY\nDa Nang, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\ngood\nAug 2026 • Business\nDuring a business trip to Ha Long, I happened to visit Banh Xeo Cuoi and was really impressed. The banh xeo was served hot and crispy, with a generous filling, fresh vegetables, and a delicious dipping sauce. The restaurant had a comfortable and welcoming atmosphere, and the staff were very friendly. It was a memorable dining experience during my trip, and I would definitely come back if I visit Ha Long again!\nRead more\nWritten August 27, 2026",
